        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Scrotal ultrasound"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Left hemiscrotum: moderate simple hydrocele with anechoic fluid around the left testis. Left testis normal in size and echotexture with no focal lesion and normal Doppler flow; epididymis unremarkable. Right testis and epididymis normal. No evidence of inguinal hernia or torsion. Report states no sonographic evidence of testicular neoplasm."
      }
    },
